# Lazy evaluation: $zip preserves thunks in both sequences
# Zip two sequences with errors in tail, only take 1 element
[call $collect [call $take 1
  [call $zip
    [call $seq 1 [call $seq [call $error "first seq tail"] []]]
    [call $seq 10 [call $seq [call $error "second seq tail"] []]]]]]
===
Dict({0: Dict({0: Int(1), 1: Int(10)})})
